[01:42.94]Hand in hand with our dear Father,
[01:49.18]We would humbly walk with him each day.
[02:04.28]Oh, how undeserved his kindness
[02:15.46]That he grants to those who seek his way!
[02:19.40]By his love God made provision;
[02:20.46]We may freely take his hand.
[02:21.83]So we make our dedication;
[02:23.13]With Jehovah we take our stand.
[02:24.69]In this day of Satan’s anger,
[02:26.06]As the end is drawing ever near,
[02:27.61]We are faced with opposition
[02:29.10]That could make us turn away in fear.
[02:30.91]But Jehovah gives protection;
[02:32.46]Close to him we want to stay,
[02:39.44]That we might forever serve him.
[02:40.56]Love him loyally, never stray.
[02:41.82]Help for us God has provided
[02:43.03]Through his spirit and his written Word,
[02:44.77]Through the Christian congregation,
[02:46.40]Through assurance that our prayer is heard.
[02:48.30]As we’re walking with Jehovah,
[02:49.56]He will help us do what’s right.
[02:50.06]He will help us to be loyal
[02:50.82]And walk modestly in his sight.
